|   Arduino      |               |      PCF8574      |               |  7-Segment Display   |
|                |               |                   |               |                      |
|   5V           |---------------| VCC               |               |                      |
|   GND          |---------------| GND               |---------------| GND                  |
|   A4 (SDA)     |---------------| SDA               |               |                      |
|   A5 (SCL)     |---------------| SCL               |               |                      |
|                |               |                   |               |                      |
|                |               |               P0  |---------------| Segment A            |
|                |               |               P1  |---------------| Segment B            |
